  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><b>Brand Introduction:</b><br>At SAINT DIAMONDS, we help people celebrate the lives and memories of their loved ones by creating stunning, one-of-a-kind memorial diamonds. Our mission is to transform cherished moments into timeless treasures, offering families a deeply personal way to honor those who matter most.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><b>Product Description:</b><br>Our journey begins with the <b>Welcome Kit</b>, the first step in creating a memorial diamond. This kit includes everything your audience needs to start the process: a secure container for ashes or hair, clear step-by-step instructions, diamond size samples, diamond cut and color information, an order form, and a shipping label to ensure the experience is smooth and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><b>Unique Selling Point (USP):</b><br>SAINT DIAMONDS stands apart by transforming love and memories into something beautiful&mdash;a certified diamond created from a loved one's hair or ashes. We are proud to offer a deeply emotional product that provides comfort and connection to families in a truly unique way.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><b>Payment Terms:</b><br>We value our affiliate partners and offer a straightforward opportunity: earn <b>$50 for every Welcome Kit sold</b> through your unique link or coupon code. Your earnings are processed promptly, ensuring you get rewarded for your efforts quickly and reliably.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><b>Other Information:</b><br>By joining our affiliate program, you&rsquo;re not just promoting a product&mdash;you&rsquo;re sharing a story of love, memory, and legacy. This is your chance to connect with an audience searching for meaningful ways to honor those they hold dear, while earning for every purchase you inspire. Let&rsquo;s make a difference together!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>",
